Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: Duplicate an Event from the listing
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

POST /admin/events/{id}/duplicate saves Event::duplicate() (all columns, title + ' (cópia)', starts_on in 7 days, no enrollments) and redirects to the copy's edit form with a flash.
---
